WEBVTT

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:04.770
SPACE DEVELOPMENT CENTER

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.320
...the flight is proceeding as planned.

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.400
2 Years Ago

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.900
No anomalies!

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.360
Engine power normal.

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:53.700
Gai Shishioh, the Space Development Center's pilot prodigy, was on a...

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:55.320
...test flight, when...

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:58.530
...he had a close encounter with Extra Intelligence Classification Number 1...

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:02.370
...otherwise known as EI-01.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.710
He was rescued by a mysterious MechaLion.

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.750
And to ensure his survival, he was...

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:12.010
...rebuilt by a team of experts led by his father, Dr. Leo Shishioh...

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:16.340
...and so was reborn as the cyborg, Gai.

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:21.170
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:24.070
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:35.070
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:41.790
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:46.070
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:50.990
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:54.910
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:57.710
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:57.710 --> 00:02:01.470
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:06.470
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:09.640
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:12.180
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:15.310
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:18.270
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:22.350
Dividing Driver!

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:29.990
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:35.870
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:38.820
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:42.710
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:44.600
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:47.770
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:50.140
The Boy With Green Hair

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:53.190
<i>The Boy With Green Hair</i>

00:02:55.820 --> 00:03:00.360
In order to stop the mechanoid EI-02's advance on the city...

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:04.910
...the defense organization GGG mobilizes GaoGaiGar, King of Braves.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:06.910
Knocking out 02 with a deadly blow...

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.790
...he is just about to crush its energy core when suddenly...

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:12.420
...a mysterious young boy appears...

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:15.210
Who in the world is he?

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.550
Curatio...

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:24.470
...teneritas, sectio...

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:28.560
...salus, coctura!

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:33.810
Is that...

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.610
...an extraterrestrial?

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:46.370
So is that the extraterrestrial's true identity?

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:49.330
No, that's a human being, no question about it.

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:09.770
The boy!

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.020
No good...

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:16.440
I can't track him even with a satellite search.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:18.940
And I can't detect any energy interaction, either...

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:25.620
Hyuuma! Take that human GaoGaiGar's holding into custody.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.530
Gotcha.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.120
GaoGaiGar is to withdraw immediately after!

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:30.700
Roger!

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:37.040
What good does it do to defeat the enemy if the city's laid to waste?

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.550
Mamoru's disappeared!

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.300
Don't tell me Mamoru's a goner...

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.100
Don't say that...

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.290
In response to the arrival of these mysterious giant robots...

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.920
...the government has established an emergency task force...

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:23.920
...and has also begun deploying aid to...

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:32.720
Oh! Mom!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:34.600
Mamoru?

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.310
Mamoru!

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:41.770
Thank goodness you're safe!

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.820
I was worried out of my mind, you know!

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:49.570
Mamoru!

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:51.280
Isamu...

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.750
Thank goodness! Thank goodness!

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.690
The Amphibious Armored Maintenance Vehicle.

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:23.860
This colossal mobile fortress was built to serve as a...

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:28.030
...maintenance area to service the Super Mechanoids of the Mobile Unit.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:31.870
The AAMV has successfully retrieved GaoGaiGar...

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:37.830
...and is about to redock with the GGG Bay Tower base station.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:42.670
Amphibious Armored Maintenance Vehicle... docking complete.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.460
GaoGaiGar will first be cleaned, and then dismantled.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:46.550
Right.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:47.760
Chief?

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:50.970
Um, thank you very much.

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:53.850
My kid brother's safe...

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:56.310
Good... I'm glad for you.

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:01.020
Sterilization in progress.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.490
Dry Flow approaching, caution!

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:11.820
Cleaning process complete.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:16.080
Start Fusion-out process after surface temperature drops to 40 degrees.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:18.620
Remove the ceiling cord at once!

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:21.540
GaoGaiGar locked down! Crane #1 starting operations!

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.960
StealthGao, fusion-out!

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:24.960
Component voltage dropping!

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.340
Connecting bus cut from A to N!

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:28.340
Laser data bus, cut!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.800
Unable to disengage the lock! Switch to external power source #3!

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.720
Gai's heart rate is dropping!

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:33.720
Crane #2. You're on standby!

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.640
Pull the breaker! Operations, do you hear me?

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:37.560
Yes, sir! Breaker #3 powered on!

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.100
Crane #2 approaching!

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:41.480
Connecting bus cut from G to N.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:44.650
LinerGao, out!

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:44.650
The cyborg's life support is failing!

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.270
Connecting bus cut from M1 to MA.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:49.570
CYS, Red 7, 6, 5...

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.570
Get the cyborg out at all costs!

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:52.740
Something's stuck in the fuel tank. We've got to stay in manual mode!

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:55.490
Connecting bus, cut 01 to 015!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.490
The cyborg's going to die!

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.910
We're working as fast as we can!

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:57.910
Unable to cut Bus 012!

00:07:57.990 --> 00:07:58.740
Force-extract!

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.660
Connecting bus, cut 012!

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:01.660
CYS, Red 8,2, 7, 8, 7...

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.250
Crane No. 3, Mode E.

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:05.500
Connecting bus, start cutting from P...

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.090
C Y Team, you're on. Just wait for the order to extract!

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:11.260
Mode E! Got that?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:13.760
DrillGao, out!

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:13.760
Get the cyborg out before the drill!

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:14.890
I know, I'm on it!

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:17.640
GaiGar, Fusion-out to Galeon.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:21.600
Fusion-out, power cut. Fusion-out, power cut.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:23.560
Recover Cyborg Gai without delay!

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:31.940
Help!

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.660
Are you all right, Gai?

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:38.530
Due to sudden stress, he's suffering a drastic drop in blood pressure.

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:40.450
Who was that boy?

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.870
You can't destroy that!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.500
This isn't good, his pupillary reactions are sluggish.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:46.540
Move it!

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.090
Hang in there, Gai!

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:50.630
Now that's what I call a mess.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:52.720
Did he sustain that damage in the battle?

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:55.090
No, this was caused by transforming.

00:08:56.470 --> 00:09:00.350
It's far exceeded the limits of the Friction Damper.

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:04.020
At any rate, this damage was caused because we haven't perfected the...

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:06.980
...timing software for the transformation sequence.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:11.150
How much time will you need to fix the software and repair the joints?

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.610
Probably about ten days or so.

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:15.990
What if the enemy strikes again during that time?

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:38.140
Awaken! Four Machine Kings!

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:43.680
Polonaise at your service, Lord Pasdar.

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:54.860
Primarda has grown weary of waiting.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.320
Your Pizza has arrived, sir!

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:07.620
Penchinon is ready to set sail immediately!

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:10.380
Who is that black robot?

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:15.550
Most likely, the Legacy of Cain. The humans appear to have inherited it.

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:20.140
At any rate, that robot we built from garbage turned out to be too weak.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:23.390
Not to mention we picked the wrong human to use as a core.

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:26.560
Are you going to make your next move?

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:29.690
Just leave it to us, Lord Pasdar.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:36.740
We'll be using an extremely vicious human this time.

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:26.580
Kamome grammar school
students abducted by robot!

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:29.540
Please, let me get by! Let me through!

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:33.130
Betcha you didn't know that real robots really stink of oil!

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:38.050
I'm telling you, it was like a roller coaster, only 27 times as scary!

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:41.800
Really, now! Disappearing on us like that, Mamoru!

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:43.220
Huh? Oh...

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.720
We were all so worried about you!

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:45.680
Humph!

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:48.850
Running off to save your own skin, what a horrible thing to do!

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:51.810
But I don't think he was actually running off...

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:52.770
You don't?

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:55.730
Oh! But how about that Super-cool DFL?

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:57.570
I'm not going to forget HIM...

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:59.740
Super-cool DFL?

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:03.320
Super-cool Dreamboat with the Flowing Locks!

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:06.080
Oh, you mean that redheaded man?

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:07.120
Uh-huh!

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:10.660
Oh, brother. You guys don't get it at all, do you?

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.500
What do you mean, Ushi?

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:13.460
If you must know...

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:16.920
He's a cyborg working for the Space Development Corporation.

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:18.500
Huh? For real?

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:21.470
My big brother works for the Space Development Corporation...

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:23.130
...so he's really in the know.

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:24.930
At that moment, I...

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:27.810
Coctura!

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:37.400
Kinzoh Kodakarayama.

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:40.230
He's a building constructor who once had government contracts...

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:43.240
...but they've suspended his license for bid-rigging.

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:45.950
As a result, his company's gone bellyup, and his family is scattered.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:50.040
Apparently he's been living on Garbage Island ever since.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:53.910
Do you suppose it was revenge that made him try to destroy City Hall?

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.130
What's his connection to EI-02?

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:59.920
We traced his memories by using hypnosis.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.460
I'm going to play the video now.

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:05.590
Four machine people told me that...

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:10.930
...if I wanted to get revenge, they'd grant me the power I needed...

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.310
What in the world is that?

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:19.940
What's going on here?

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:24.240
That's the horse he lost his money on when he placed one last bet to...

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:27.110
...stave off bankruptcy, but then lost big time.

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:34.250
The host human's emotions and experience influence the robot's form.

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:48.970
The Death Match Championship Round is about to begin!

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.720
A one-match battle with no time limits!

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:55.560
100m in the air, complete with time bomb-equipped barbed-wire...

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:58.810
...which will provide an electric current blast!

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:03.190
In the blue corner, the challenger...

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:06.650
Tiger Ihara!

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:11.530
And in the red corner, the reigning SMW champion...

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:15.330
Death Bomber!

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:28.010
Ayame, this is too scary! Let's go home now!

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:31.390
Way to go, Bomber! That's it! Take that guy out!

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:35.020
Drop dead!

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:42.110
He's tripped the switch for the time bomb!

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.150
There'll be an explosion in 7...

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:45.190
6...

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:47.570
...5, 4...

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:50.070
...3, 2...

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:50.910
...1!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.290
Crap!

00:14:58.080 --> 00:14:59.710
I'm the strongest!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.630
I'm the best in the world!

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.790
No way am I gonna lose!

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:08.970
You don't have to tell me. You are the best in the world.

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:12.090
Wouldn't you like to create more and more destruction?

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:15.930
I'm going to give you a very special present...

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.070
It's that same feeling I got before.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:23.670
Gai, you can't get up yet!

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:26.130
You don't have to worry. I'm a cyborg!

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:35.340
I've got to get there! I've got to get there!

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:48.020
Galeon!

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.790
Fusion!

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:15.470
GaiGar!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.000
Gai!

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:46.920
GaiGar's reached his limit!

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:50.340
Uh-oh, looks like his self-defense system's taken a hit.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:54.260
He's pumping far more adrenaline than normal.

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:55.170
Chief?

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.180
We're going to have him transform?

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.340
And what are the odds of success?

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:03.770
Since we're not done perfecting the software, I'd have to say about 30%.

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:05.680
And if it ends in failure...

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:11.860
The shock will smash both Gai and the machines to smithereens.

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:21.200
Hurry, approve it!

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:25.040
The difference between 30% and 100% is sheer guts...

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.710
That's what makes a hero!

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.370
Final Fusion, approved!

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:31.790
Roger...

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.460
Final Fusion...

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:36.510
Program Drive!

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:50.100
Final Fusion!

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:10.290
No!

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.670
We can continue with the Final Fusion process.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:15.630
You can do it, Gai!

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:16.480
GaoGaiGar!

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:20.110
He did it!

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:21.740
Final Fusion complete!

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:25.570
That's what you call a true hero!

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:38.840
Protect Shade!

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:43.720
Plasma Hold!

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:48.890
Take that!

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.100
I'm not done yet!

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:03.240
Broken Magnum!

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:18.920
Hell and Heaven!

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:24.300
Gemu, giru, gan, go, gufo!

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:28.510
Hell and Heaven...

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:31.600
...also known as GaoGaiGar's ultimate attack...

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:35.640
...combining both offensive and defensive energies into one.

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:52.450
Gai, you mustn't crush that core.

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:54.250
There's a human being inside!

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:59.580
Gai's adrenaline level has shot up into the danger zone!

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:02.500
Gai is no longer able to control himself!

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:07.970
Stop it!

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:11.050
You can't destroy that!

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:12.810
What?

00:22:30.910 --> 00:22:34.290
Professor, Gai's adrenaline level is plummeting...

00:22:34.410 --> 00:22:37.960
It's going down? So Gai's rage is cooling.

00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:41.790
Who in the world is that boy?

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:50.350
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:55.220
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.620 --> 00:23:01.400
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:06.190
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:10.360
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:17.290
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.350 --> 00:23:24.050
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:28.710
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:34.050
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:40.950
someday in the Sea of Stars.
